    "sentence_translations": [
      "How do Chinese people kill time during a train ride?",
      "",
      "In China, there are a lot of people taking trains.",
      "The length of the train ride varies a lot.",
      "Long trips could take more than 40 hours and the shorter ones could last as short as 10 minutes.",
      "However, no matter if the trip is long or short Chinese people will always take some snacks, drinks and games with them.",
      "This could include chicken claws, sunflower seeds, instant noodles, soft drinks, beer, Chinese baijiu and cards.",
      "They can also buy these things on the train.",
      "People not only enjoy themselves, they also invite strangers next to them.",
      "Chinese people think this makes the trip more enjoyable and kills time. However, many foreigners find them too noisy.",
      "If you are not used to this behavior you can listen to music or watch a movie on the train.",
      ""
    ]
